s.harvard.edu/abs/2010Geo....38.1079S" class="external text" id="mwARo">2010Geo....38.1079S</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwARs">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1130%2FG31182.1" class="external text" id="mwARw">10.1130/G31182.1</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Geology&amp;rft.atitle=Rainforest+Collapse+Triggered+Pennsylvanian+Tetrapod+Diversification+in+Euramerica&amp;rft.volume=38&amp;rft.issue=12&amp;rft.pages=1079-1082&amp;rft.date=2010&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1130%2FG31182.1&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F2010Geo....38.1079S&amp;rft.aulast=Sahney&amp;rft.aufirst=S.&amp;rft.au=Benton%2C+M.+J.&amp;rft.au=Falcon-Lang%2C+H.+J.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AInsular+biogeography" class="Z3988" about="#mwt19" id="mwAR0"></span></span></li>
